OL,3,APoundland supplier 'will lose millions'
OL,4,Aif retailer collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Poundland's suppliers has said
OL,7,Fit will lose millions if the firm
OL,8,Fcollapses.
OL,10,FWhile that supplier will stay afloat,
OL,11,Fit is feared that some small and
OL,12,Fmedium-sized suppliers could go under.
OL,14,FThis is in addition to potentially
OL,15,Fthousands of job losses among staff.
OL,17,FPoliticians have been putting questions
OL,18,Fto representatives of Poundland owners
OL,19,FGordon Brothers this week seeking
OL,20,F"clarity" on plans for the retailer.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
